<title>POLAND: Relpol Q2 net rises to PLN 1.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Relpol Q2 net rises to PLN 1.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Relpol preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     1.68   vs    1.67</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 2.74   vs    2.31</p>
<p>    net profit			     1.67   vs    1.49</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Relpol SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     13.21   vs    9.80</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 9.40   vs    6.55</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.01   vs    0.41</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.06   vs    0.41</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   3.89   vs    2.75 loss</p>
<p>    financial costs			2.84   vs    3.39 loss</p>
<p>    investment			     3.13   vs    1.03</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     3.07   vs    3.19</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 5.31   vs    4.31</p>
<p>    net profit			     3.37   vs    2.84</p>
<p>    net sales			     24.58   vs   19.83</p>
<p>    costs of sales			17.53   vs   13.80</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.62   vs    0.93</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.33   vs    0.55</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   6.65   vs    4.18</p>
<p>    financial costs			4.40   vs    3.06</p>
<p>    investment			     6.22   vs    1.27</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
